Run in the foreground until SIGINT or SIGTERM (Ctrl+C on Windows)

Usage: aulod run [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <FILE>  Read this file instead of <home>/config.toml; the home itself stays where it
                       is
      --listen <ADDR>  TCP address for remote clients (host:port), overriding daemon.listen; needs
                       TLS
  -h, --help           Print help
